Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.95,0:01:44.95,sign_407_1_Kouban_Private_H,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs10\move(611.889,218,435,217.111,25,3988)}Kouban \NPrefectural \NHigh\N School
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.08,0:01:49.08,sign_7050_55_Episode_1_______,Eptitle sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(483,472)\pos(431.889,304.333)}Episode 3               Lessons in Love?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.40,0:01:57.59,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Oh, Senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.06,0:01:59.80,main,Rin,0,0,0,,What are you reading there?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.22,0:02:04.22,sign_2907_5_The_Perfect_Guid,Book sign,0,0,0,,{\blur1\b1\frz350.4}The Perfect Guide to Dating
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.22,0:02:04.22,sign_2907_6_Start_with__the_,Book sign,0,0,0,,{\blur2\b0\frz4.298\pos(282.778,172.222)}Start with \Nthe basics!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.47,0:02:05.80,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,After today, I'll be a hit \Nwith the chicks...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.03,0:02:08.35,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,My dream of a harem will soon be a reality!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.92,0:02:14.36,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Nanakura, I understand how \Ngirls think now thanks to this book!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.75,0:02:20.37,main,Cool Rin,0,0,0,,Then do you understand why I'm angry?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.08,0:02:25.36,main,Spoiled Rin,0,0,0,,I wish you knew why I was mad!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.59,0:02:27.35,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,You too, Spoiled-chan?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.35,0:02:29.38,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Hang on, wait, just a sec...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.08,0:02:33.15,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Because I said something stupid again?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.59,0:02:37.14,main,Rin,0,0,0,,That's half right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.88,0:02:41.37,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Honestly, I just wish I was in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.14,0:02:45.44,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Does that mean you're not right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.56,0:02:48.14,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Not that I've noticed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.23,0:02:52.14,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,I don't know how to feel about that...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.39,0:02:56.65,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I mean, it all started \Nwith the bits that we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.04,0:03:01.31,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,They might just be bits, \Nbut you're serious about the acting, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.04,0:03:08.35,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Which gets me thinking \Nabout who I would choose during class...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.39,0:03:10.84,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Wow, you're really happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.34,0:03:15.16,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Oh, but I think I might understand why.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.61,0:03:17.15,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,It's because I praised your acting!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.15,0:03:18.92,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Bzzt!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.53,0:03:26.80,main,Wardrobe,0,0,0,,Okay, your makeup's done, Nanakura-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.21,0:03:30.30,main,Wardrobe,0,0,0,,Or maybe "Class President Nanakura"?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.43,0:03:32.69,main,Rin (Prez),0,0,0,,Thank you for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.16,0:03:35.19,main,Rin (Prez),0,0,0,,I can face my duties now, \Nwith your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.73,0:03:40.13,main - italics,Wardrobe,0,0,0,,She can really switch it on \Nin an instant. Such an actress.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.60,0:03:54.73,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Hey, you've got a different vibe.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.73,0:03:58.33,main,Rin,0,0,0,,It's really helping me get \Ninto the role of class president.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.33,0:04:00.04,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.04,0:04:03.82,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,A relationship with a serious class \Npresident type would be awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.82,0:04:07.60,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,First thing I'd do is join the\N student council to get closer to her...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.83,0:04:11.72,main,Rin(Prez),0,0,0,,Do you honestly think you can function \Nin student government with ulterior motives?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.20,0:04:13.48,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.71,0:04:15.21,main,Rin,0,0,0,,He backed down so easily!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.98,0:04:19.48,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Kind of hard for the conversation \Nto go anywhere if you do that...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.72,0:04:27.15,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I feel like I'm the kinda guy who'd get \Npurged from the student council, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.03,0:04:31.53,main,Rin(Prez),0,0,0,,On second thought, \Nyour application will be accepted.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.39,0:04:36.24,main,Rin(Prez),0,0,0,,My goal is to create a school \Nwhere everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.43,0:04:38.72,main,Rin(Prez),0,0,0,,can look forward to \Nattending class, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.49,0:04:47.76,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Class President... your hand is so soft!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.93,0:04:51.39,main,Rin,0,0,0,,You can't just say \Nthings like that, Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.35,0:04:55.90,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,What would you do if you really \Nwere class president?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.90,0:04:57.92,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Let me think...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.81,0:05:03.15,main,Rin (Prez),0,0,0,,I'd like there to be classes \Nthat mixed grades could attend.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.57,0:05:08.36,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,You mean like first-years and \Nthird-years in the same classroom?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.69,0:05:09.29,main,Rin(Prez),0,0,0,,Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.57,0:05:14.04,main,Rin(Prez),0,0,0,,It'd increase exchange between \Nstudents outside of extracurriculars.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.93,0:05:17.38,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Man, that's a legit president-type proposal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.94,0:05:21.29,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,So, what are you really after?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.30,0:05:25.04,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Theoretically... just, \Nspeaking theoretically!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.63,0:05:29.92,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Someone could then share a class \Nwith an upperclassman they have a crush on...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.12,0:05:33.92,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure illicit romantic relationships \Nare a bad idea for a class president!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.12,0:05:39.94,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Oh, that's the club president. \NIt's a good likeness!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.96,0:05:43.20,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Ain't it though?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.83,0:05:46.06,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,He's good at doing caricatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.04,0:05:48.71,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Want me to draw you, Nanakura?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.03,0:05:53.61,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Done!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.94,0:05:56.45,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.28,0:06:00.43,main,Rin,0,0,0,,What a glare!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.43,0:06:02.37,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,That's Cool-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.92,0:06:06.52,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Do I really look so aggressive?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.52,0:06:09.88,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Well, the trick is taking characteristic \Ntraits and emphasizing them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.69,0:06:13.23,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,This is kind of embarrassing...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.73,0:06:16.47,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I drew Imp-chan too!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.47,0:06:18.45,main,Rin,0,0,0,,That's a literal devil!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.77,0:06:24.27,sign_17213_188_Dying_Inside__,Sfx sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H6E5FC5&\3c&H2A327C&\move(257.889,78.556,297,59.889,25,2488)}{\blur1}Staaare
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.79,0:06:23.91,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,I'm not even sure looking at me \Nis serving a purpose, considering...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.97,0:06:27.02,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Oh, cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.02,0:06:28.99,main,Rin,0,0,0,,This one is cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.37,0:06:33.40,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Yeah? You are pretty cute, Nanakura!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.55,0:06:39.28,main,Rin,0,0,0,,The drawing! I was talking \Nabout your drawing!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.28,0:06:42.20,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,C'mon, no need to be modest.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.20,0:06:43.02,main,Rin,0,0,0,,That's not...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.44,0:06:47.03,main,Rin,0,0,0,,It really really really really \Nisn't what I meant!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.67,0:06:53.68,sign_407_1_Kouban_Private_H,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H979DBB&\move(579,74.888,448.333,74.888,28,5993)}Kouban \NPrefectural\N High \NSchool
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.78,0:06:53.68,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Nanakura, do you act differently in the club\Ncompared to when you're with your classmates?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.68,0:06:56.79,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.13,0:07:00.44,main,Rin,0,0,0,,But maybe I seem a bit different\Nbecause I'm not trying to be polite.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.26,0:07:03.82,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,So, try being casual with me, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.94,0:07:09.70,sign_10189_86_Foreign_Residenc,Sign,0,0,0,,{\frz2.743\pos(315.555,286.556)}{\blur2}FOREIGN RESIDENCE
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.63,0:07:08.23,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Let's start by talking about movies.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.44,0:07:09.69,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,You seen "Foreign Residence?"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.06,0:07:11.84,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I have not...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.84,0:07:13.34,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,You have not?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.25,0:07:16.06,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I mean, nah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.06,0:07:19.59,main,Rin,0,0,0,,That's a horror movie, \Ny'know? Way too scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.91,0:07:21.72,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,It seriously is scary, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.01,0:07:24.68,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I'm impressed you can stand them...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.68,0:07:26.90,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Eh, it's an educational thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.90,0:07:28.94,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,They tend to do a lot of stuff with sets...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.94,0:07:31.37,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Maybe you could study \Nthe acting bits, Nanakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.37,0:07:34.84,main,Rin,0,0,0,,No! No way! I just can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.40,0:07:37.35,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Well, what if we watched one together?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.73,0:07:42.72,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Do you mind if I cry the entire time...?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.72,0:07:44.64,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,That might not be great.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.19,0:07:49.69,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,This feels like we're dating! I love it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.20,0:07:52.78,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Having a more casual conversation \Nwith you is pretty refreshing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.07,0:07:56.91,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Although it does feel like I've taken \Na hit to my senpai aura, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.29,0:08:00.12,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I totally respect you, though, Senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.76,0:08:03.91,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Huh? You're still being casual?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.91,0:08:06.11,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I think I'll keep this up for this week.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.11,0:08:09.69,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Oh, you're enjoying yourself, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.76,0:08:19.05,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,No... it's Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.34,0:08:22.35,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,Is he alone? I wanna talk to him...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.70,0:08:25.05,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,I wish I was better dressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.20,0:08:32.07,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Hey, it's Nanakura!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.11,0:08:37.64,main,Rin,0,0,0,,W-W-Wha... Wha... you...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.83,0:08:43.83,sign_7050_55_Episode_1_______,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs14\c&H2F2F34&\b1\pos(327.888,296.333)}{\blur0.5}Kouban High School\N Drama Club
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.37,0:08:42.94,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Senpai... that shirt...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.17,0:08:45.92,main,Rin,0,0,0,,We made those for the culture festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.33,0:08:50.32,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Come on, Nanakura, you're \Nnot exactly dressed up either!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.48,0:08:56.59,main,Cool Rin,0,0,0,,I don't really follow fashion trends.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.72,0:08:58.54,main,Cool Rin,0,0,0,,Is it weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.63,0:09:01.98,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,N-No, it's not...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.45,0:09:04.85,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,But if you need advice, \Nyou wanna go shopping together?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.56,0:09:07.33,main,Cool Rin,0,0,0,,I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.39,0:09:10.12,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Then again, given how we're both dressed,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.12,0:09:12.30,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,we probably won't end up \Npicking anything decent!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.38,0:09:16.73,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I normally dress perfectly fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.37,0:09:20.12,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,You saying I'm the only unfashionable one?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.30,0:09:24.73,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,W... Would you please go \Nclothes shopping with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.16,0:09:36.95,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Hey, Nanakura, are you \Ngrowing your hair out?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.95,0:09:37.87,main,Rin,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.87,0:09:39.86,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I'm thinking about getting a cut,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.86,0:09:42.30,main,Rin,0,0,0,,but I haven't been able to make up my mind \Nabout how short I want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.05,0:09:46.52,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,A new 'do, huh. I can see \Nwhy you'd wanna be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.05,0:09:49.27,main,Imp Rin,0,0,0,,You had better say it's cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.52,0:09:53.16,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I... I couldn't say something \Nthat embarrassing...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.16,0:09:55.93,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Then again, if you had short hair...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.20,0:09:58.03,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Let me imagine it for a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.36,0:10:11.42,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,But at what cost?! The pigtails!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.94,0:10:16.24,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,He seems more anxious about it than me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.30,0:10:24.74,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I don't like how much maintenance it takes \Nto keep it under control when it's long.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.35,0:10:29.81,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,You put the work \Nin when no one's looking, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.53,0:10:32.76,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,That's admirable!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.08,0:10:36.40,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I can tell your ends and texture \Nare on another level.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.05,0:10:42.28,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Do head rubs usually make you clam up?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.61,0:10:45.26,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I don't think I'll cut \Nit short, after all...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.92,0:10:54.92,main,Prez,0,0,0,,So, you want to be actors, huh? \NI like your ambition.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.35,0:10:56.86,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,We've got new members.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.12,0:11:01.30,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Since they wanna be acting, \Nthat makes them your kouhai, Nanakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.64,0:11:04.68,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Make sure to help them out if they need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.08,0:11:08.43,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I wonder if I'll be able to...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.43,0:11:12.30,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,If you can't give good advice, they'll \Nstop asking you about stuff in general.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.30,0:11:14.07,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I don't like the sound of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.39,0:11:18.44,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Huh, have I ever asked you for advice...?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.76,0:11:24.71,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,How can I become the kind of \Nsenpai people rely on?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.64,0:11:27.91,main,Rin(Demure),0,0,0,,In your case, I'd suggest...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.62,0:11:31.28,main,Rin(Demure),0,0,0,,Maybe taking things a bit more seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.68,0:11:37.08,main,Rin(Demure),0,0,0,,But that's not meant to be \Na rejection of how you normally act.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.65,0:11:40.43,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Is that... Demure-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.97,0:11:42.96,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Was it mature enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.96,0:11:45.64,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,It sure as heck was!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.64,0:11:46.99,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.28,0:11:50.07,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,You've got a total babyface now, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.07,0:11:51.64,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Gonna have to work on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.74,0:11:54.64,main,Rin,0,0,0,,H-Hang on a second...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.82,0:11:59.40,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Hey, Nanakura, I could \Nuse some more advice...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.40,0:12:03.00,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I can't do it if you make me laugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.48,0:12:12.54,main,Rin,0,0,0,,It's not quite steady.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.54,0:12:13.92,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.22,0:12:16.07,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Are you going to remake it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.08,0:12:20.67,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I bet Tsundere-chan isn't great \Nwith heights, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.59,0:12:22.40,main,Rin,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's{\i0} your concern?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.20,0:12:25.29,main,TsundeRin,0,0,0,,This isn't even that high up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.53,0:12:28.04,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Quit shaking it! That's actually dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.79,0:12:32.81,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Come on. I need \Nto reinforce it, so get down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.52,0:12:42.12,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Y-You want me to... jump down?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.12,0:12:44.48,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,That's fine too. I'll hold you steady.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.72,0:12:46.27,main,Rin,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.94,0:12:52.37,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I'd have to be like "Fwump" \Nand I'll be "Eek" and then "Ahhh!"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.87,0:12:57.00,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I don't know if I can pull that off cutely!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.31,0:12:58.76,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.05,0:13:00.54,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Hang on. Wait, wait, wait....
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.54,0:13:01.92,main,Rin,0,0,0,,This is really, really, really scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.22,0:13:03.76,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Senpai, don't shake it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.21,0:13:05.09,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Just wait a sec!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.72,0:13:07.92,main - top,Eiji,0,0,0,,I'm not doing anything! What is with you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.27,0:13:11.64,main,Prez,0,0,0,,What are you two up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.64,0:13:15.89,main,Eiji/Rin,0,0,0,,Prez! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.89,0:13:20.90,sign_18558_208_Psuedo_Harem,Eyecatch sign,0,0,0,,{\c&HF1D9FF&\pos(159.556,285.556)}Pse{\c&HFFFDC6&}udo {\c&HFFFFFF&}Harem
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.90,0:13:25.90,sign_18558_208_Psuedo_Harem,Eyecatch sign,0,0,0,,{\c&HF1D9FF&\pos(556,130.889)}Pse{\c&HFFFDC6&}udo\N {\c&HFFFFFF&}Harem
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.90,0:13:28.87,sign_7050_55_Episode_1_______,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H575757&\frz11.79\pos(438.112,76.778)}Class 4-1
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.13,0:13:31.24,main,Rin,0,0,0,,It's you, Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.24,0:13:33.36,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,That was when I was in fourth grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.64,0:13:37.74,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Was that a shutter?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.44,0:13:45.51,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Seriously, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.75,0:13:47.60,main,Rin,0,0,0,,There you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.49,0:13:51.48,main,Rin,0,0,0,,You seem to be having a ton of fun \Nwith those rolls in your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.48,0:13:55.14,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I was really hyped about \Nthat breakfast buffet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.57,0:13:57.64,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Another one?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.05,0:14:00.29,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Who gets that happy \Nover something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.29,0:14:02.78,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I'd ask who doesn't get hype for a buffet!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.67,0:14:09.80,main,Demure Rin,0,0,0,,Seeing you so happy puts me \Nin a good mood, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.74,0:14:13.16,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I mean, I wouldn't act like \Nthat at this age!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.56,0:14:16.41,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Buffets are really fun, though...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.88,0:14:22.55,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,I'm sure I would've \Nliked him back then, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.24,0:14:32.68,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Shouldn't you be in the \Ngymnasium, Miss Star Actress?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.23,0:14:36.44,main,Imp Rin,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll skip.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.69,0:14:40.11,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I can see how Imp-chan would skip out on—
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.11,0:14:41.07,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.56,0:14:44.59,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Are you hijacking Nanakura's normal life?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.96,0:14:48.44,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I was rehearsing all day \Nyesterday, so she just kinda...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.84,0:14:51.61,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Is this like, you're having \Ntrouble getting out of character?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.08,0:14:53.78,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,That must be rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.28,0:14:58.65,main,Imp Rin,0,0,0,,So, can I stick around and bug you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.08,0:15:02.57,main - italics,Eiji,0,0,0,,Nanakura... has she developed \Na will of her own?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.99,0:15:07.35,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Imp-chan is gonna take \Nadvantage of me at this rate!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.35,0:15:08.92,main,Rin,0,0,0,,She will not!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.20,0:15:11.44,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.38,0:15:14.65,main,Imp Rin,0,0,0,,But if I tried, would you let me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.69,0:15:20.60,main,Rin,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Senpai?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.60,0:15:23.31,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,That was Imp-chan's fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.65,0:15:27.56,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Not being able to shake off a character... \Nmaybe you're practicing too hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.69,0:15:30.86,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry for getting in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.86,0:15:32.47,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Do you have an idea for how to fix this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.47,0:15:35.70,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I think portraying another \Ncharacter might work...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.44,0:15:41.44,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I should probably head \Nto practice after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.31,0:15:46.84,main,Prez,0,0,0,,Nanakura?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.25,0:15:49.68,main,Prez,0,0,0,,Rehearsal's started.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.14,0:15:54.33,main,Female Club B,0,0,0,,She's not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.33,0:15:56.24,main,Prez,0,0,0,,Maybe she's taking the day off?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.24,0:15:57.46,main,Female Club B,0,0,0,,Probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.91,0:16:02.93,main,Prez,0,0,0,,Let's go, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.68,0:16:04.72,main,Female Club B,0,0,0,,I guess we should.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.04,0:16:12.56,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Maybe Imp-chan was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.54,0:16:16.34,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,You could use a break, Nanakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.83,0:16:18.28,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Let's skip club together.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.36,0:16:25.21,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Especially since my thumb hurts \Ntoo much to get any work done.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.21,0:16:27.08,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Let's get you to the nurse's office, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.60,0:16:38.45,main,Rin,0,0,0,,That's your old coat, right, Senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.45,0:16:39.56,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Sure is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.56,0:16:42.15,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,It was used as a costume\Nand then they returned it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.82,0:16:45.18,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Did you do that thing \Nat middle school graduation,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.18,0:16:48.76,main,Rin,0,0,0,,where you give the second button \Nto someone you like, or vice versa?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.00,0:16:52.30,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,What is that? I've never heard of it before.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.57,0:16:56.03,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Wait, does this mean everyone else did it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.03,0:16:58.16,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Seems likely...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.39,0:17:00.84,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Is that different from confessing normally?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.84,0:17:02.28,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.27,0:17:11.17,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,We're graduating today, \Nso I want you to have this, Nanakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.85,0:17:17.62,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Well? What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.32,0:17:24.43,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I didn't really catch it all. \NCould you do it again?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.72,0:17:28.21,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,But that was a really good take!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.21,0:17:30.40,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Just one more time!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.96,0:17:37.44,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Will you accept my second button...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.12,0:17:42.24,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Imp-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.94,0:17:47.58,main,Rin,0,0,0,,She's not in today!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.71,0:17:51.03,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,But it's graduation!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.85,0:17:59.96,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,No love letters today...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.16,0:18:00.97,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.97,0:18:04.22,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,That means no hearts for me to break.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.56,0:18:08.35,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Senpai, haven't you been \Ndoing that act every morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.55,0:18:11.82,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Any time is a good time \Nto polish your acting skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.82,0:18:14.33,main,Rin,0,0,0,,But Senpai... you're in the props department.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.61,0:18:23.90,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Actually getting one was so much \Nof a shock I was speechless!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.64,0:18:26.57,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Is this for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.36,0:18:29.82,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,It's like a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.13,0:18:32.88,sign_407_1_Kouban_Private_H,Signature Signs,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&H272727&\pos(288.334,89.111)\frz10.58}Imp-chan
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.13,0:18:32.88,sign_407_1_Kouban_Private_H,Signature Signs,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&H272727&\pos(335.445,204.667)\frz7.096}Tsundere-chan
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.17,0:18:34.65,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,It was a dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.13,0:18:42.51,sign_26761_268_I_was_kind_of_ho,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H6E696A&\pos(254.556,174.444)}I was kind of hoping your shoe box \Nwould stay empty forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.67,0:18:42.51,main - italics,Imp Rin,0,0,0,,I was kind of hoping your shoe \Nbox would stay empty forever!{also sign}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.61,0:18:47.64,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,She's saying she doesn't want me to \Naccept anyone else's love letters, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.61,0:18:52.52,main,Imp Rin,0,0,0,,Do you really need me \Nto spell it out for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.77,0:19:02.16,sign_26761_268_I_was_kind_of_ho,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(258.667,179.778)\c&H727070&}You just looked really desperate for a love letter! \NThat's all! That's the only reason! \NSo don't get any weird ideas!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.42,0:18:57.95,main - italics,TsundeRin,0,0,0,,You just looked really \Ndesperate for a love letter!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.95,0:18:59.68,main - italics,TsundeRin,0,0,0,,That's all! That's the only reason!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.03,0:19:02.16,main - italics,TsundeRin,0,0,0,,So don't get any weird ideas! {also sign}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.35,0:19:03.31,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Weird ideas?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.16,0:19:06.66,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,But I had weird ideas before \NI even opened the envelope...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.12,0:19:13.41,main,TsundeRin,0,0,0,,You had better write a response, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.60,0:19:15.33,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I got it covered!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.33,0:19:17.80,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,This town's about to have \Na letter paper shortage!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.76,0:19:21.38,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Then again, we are in a paperless age...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.85,0:19:23.13,main,Rin,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.84,0:19:29.68,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Someone who got love letters from \Nthese two would have a hard call to make!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.92,0:19:32.44,main,Rin,0,0,0,,It's a good thing they \Nwere just pretend, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.60,0:19:35.00,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I'm gonna cherish them anyway!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.00,0:19:37.68,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Especially since it's unlikely \NI'll ever get any more!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.24,0:19:39.96,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Oh shoot, my treasures...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.10,0:19:45.88,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,"Dear Kitahama-senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.88,0:19:49.46,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,It's a little embarrassing to go out of my \Nway to write this down as a letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.45,0:19:53.76,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,The time I spend \Nwith you is always such fun,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.76,0:19:55.47,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,and even outside of club—"
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.72,0:20:00.08,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,But I hadn't finished reading it yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.28,0:20:04.22,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I... didn't mean to actually send this one!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.22,0:20:06.42,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Let me finish reading it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.42,0:20:10.60,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I-I-It's too embarrassing, so no!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.00,0:20:13.52,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Please forget you ever saw it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.65,0:20:15.94,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.63,0:20:20.28,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,But I think I'll need to read it \Nonce to properly forget it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.28,0:20:22.91,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I said no!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.71,0:20:31.80,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.28,0:20:34.51,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Good afternoon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.56,0:20:37.24,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,You seem to be in a good mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.22,0:20:41.29,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I helped a friend resolve \Nsome romantic trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.59,0:20:43.52,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Relationship advice, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.52,0:20:47.42,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Well, considering you've got five romance \Nexperts bouncing around in your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.42,0:20:49.43,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Don't make them sound like \Nalternate personalities...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.43,0:20:52.80,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I don't think anyone would ever turn \Nto me for that kinda advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.14,0:20:57.20,main,Rin,0,0,0,,If you had feelings for someone that you \Ndon't have a lot of shared interests with,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.20,0:20:58.94,main,Rin,0,0,0,,how would you approach them?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.52,0:21:00.26,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I'd try hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.81,0:21:05.32,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Are you sure you're just not \Nthat interested in dating, Senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.32,0:21:07.52,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Hard to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.52,0:21:10.70,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,But if that's how the romance \Nmaster sees it, maybe it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.38,0:21:17.27,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I can see the appeal, y'know?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.27,0:21:21.97,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I wanna have my heart pound \Nand butterflies in my stomach, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.18,0:21:28.91,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I don't really think you'd act that way,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.91,0:21:32.22,main,Rin,0,0,0,,even if you did fall in love \Nwith someone, Senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.56,0:21:34.91,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,If the master thinks so, \Nthen it's probably true.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.71,0:21:37.50,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,He's accepting everything I say!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.88,0:21:40.60,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Also, in this master's opinion,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.60,0:21:43.72,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I think you'd be better off \Nwith someone younger...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.48,0:21:45.39,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.87,0:21:48.34,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,If you say so, Master, then I bet it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.78,0:21:53.12,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Wait, are you saying...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.30,0:21:56.37,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,That I should get into little girls?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.41,0:22:02.18,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I didn't mean that much younger!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.89,0:23:35.89,sign_33852_355_Much_Ado_About_N,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(324.2,94.2)\3c&H4767A6&}Much Ado About Nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.34,0:23:34.83,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Much
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.83,0:23:35.30,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Ado
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.30,0:23:35.88,main,Rin,0,0,0,,About Nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.39,0:23:40.76,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Hello, Kitaha...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.76,0:23:43.60,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I mean, Nanakura residence.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.24,0:23:46.90,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I think it might be better \Nthe other way around!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.88,0:23:50.08,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,He's sticking to this premise \Nof him marrying into my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.08,0:23:52.08,main,,0,0,0,,
